{
 "slug": "estudo-de-caso/prever-atrasos",
 "modulo": "estudo-de-caso",
 "tipo": "caso",
 "titulo": "Estudo de caso: risco de atraso com validação temporal",
 "nav": "Machine Learning: risco de atraso",
 "sobretitulo": "Estudo de caso · dados abertos da ANAC",
 "descricao": "O que faz: estima, para cada voo da malha, a probabilidade de partir mais de 30 minutos atrasado, usando só o que se sabe quando a malha é montada .",
 "origem": {
  "material": "Estudo de caso ANAC",
  "trecho": "seção 10"
 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-10\">10. Machine Learning: risco de atraso na partida maior que 30 minutos</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> estima, para cada voo da malha, a probabilidade de partir mais de 30 minutos atrasado, usando <strong>só o que se sabe quando a malha é montada</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para priorizar recursos antes do dia do voo: tripulação e aeronave reserva, reforço de equipe em solo, ajuste de horários com risco alto de forma repetida.</p>\n<h3 id=\"secao-10-1\">10.1 Variáveis e ausência de vazamento</h3>\n<div aria-label=\"10.1 Variáveis e ausência de vazamento\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Variável</th>\n<th>Por que é conhecida antes do voo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>companhia, origem, destino</td>\n<td>estão na malha</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hora prevista, dia da semana, mês</td>\n<td>estão na malha</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>duração prevista (chegada prevista − partida prevista)</td>\n<td>está na malha</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partidas previstas no aeródromo de origem na mesma hora; chegadas previstas no destino na mesma hora</td>\n<td>contadas na própria malha (congestionamento programado)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Ficam de fora, de propósito: horário real, atraso, situação do voo (realizado ou cancelado) e qualquer agregado calculado com dados do período de teste.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">dados_ml = <span class=\"tk-fn\">q</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WITH programados AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        SELECT *, date_trunc(</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hour</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, partida_prevista) AS hora_partida, date_trunc(</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hour</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, chegada_prevista) AS hora_chegada</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">        FROM fato_voo WHERE situacao IN (</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">REALIZADO</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">CANCELADO</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    partidas AS (SELECT origem_icao, hora_partida, count(*) AS partidas_origem_hora FROM programados GROUP BY ALL),</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    chegadas AS (SELECT destino_icao, hora_chegada, count(*) AS chegadas_destino_hora FROM programados GROUP BY ALL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT e.empresa, p.origem_icao AS origem, p.destino_icao AS destino, p.hora_prevista,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           isodow(p.data_id) AS dia_semana, month(p.data_id) AS mes, p.data_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           date_diff(</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">minute</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, p.partida_prevista, p.chegada_prevista) AS duracao_prevista_min,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           partidas_origem_hora, chegadas_destino_hora,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           (p.atraso_partida_min &gt; 30)::INT AS alvo</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM programados AS p</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    JOIN dim_empresa AS e USING (empresa_icao)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    LEFT JOIN partidas USING (origem_icao, hora_partida)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    LEFT JOIN chegadas USING (destino_icao, hora_chegada)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WHERE p.horario_real_valido            -- o alvo só existe para voos realizados com horário válido</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">VARIAVEIS = [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">origem</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">destino</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hora_prevista</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dia_semana</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao_prevista_min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">             <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">partidas_origem_hora</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">chegadas_destino_hora</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">PROIBIDAS = {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">partida_real</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">chegada_real</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">atraso_partida_min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">atraso_chegada_min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">situacao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">alvo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">data_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">assert</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">not</span> PROIBIDAS &amp; <span class=\"tk-bi\">set</span>(VARIAVEIS), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">vazamento: variável conhecida só depois do voo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(dados_ml), <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> voos; taxa de atraso &gt; 30 min: </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * dados_ml.alvo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>())<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> %</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">2.699.016 voos; taxa de atraso &gt; 30 min: 7,5 %</pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"secao-10-2\">10.2 Divisão temporal</h3>\n<p>Os dados são divididos <strong>por data, sem embaralhar</strong>: o modelo é sempre avaliado em meses posteriores aos que viu no treino, como acontece na prática.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"por data, sem embaralhar\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Conjunto</th>\n<th>Período</th>\n<th>Uso</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>treino</td>\n<td>jan/2023 a jun/2025</td>\n<td>ajustar os candidatos</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>validação</td>\n<td>jul a dez/2025</td>\n<td>escolher a configuração</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>teste</td>\n<td>jan a ago/2026</td>\n<td>medir o desempenho final, uma única vez</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>As categorias (aeródromos) são definidas só com o treino; aeródromo novo no teste vira <code>OUTROS</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">preparar</span>(df, categorias=<span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    df = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">copy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> categorias <span class=\"tk-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">        categorias = {c: <span class=\"tk-bi\">sorted</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">set</span>(df[c].<span class=\"tk-fn\">value_counts</span>().index[:<span class=\"tk-num\">200</span>]) | {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">OUTROS</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>}) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> c <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">origem</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">destino</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> c, valores <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> categorias.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">        df[c] = df[c].<span class=\"tk-fn\">where</span>(df[c].<span class=\"tk-fn\">isin</span>(valores), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">OUTROS</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">astype</span>(pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">CategoricalDtype</span>(valores))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> df, categorias</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">datas = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_datetime</span>(dados_ml.data_id)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">treino_cru = dados_ml[datas &lt; CORTE_VALIDACAO]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">valid_cru = dados_ml[(datas &gt;= CORTE_VALIDACAO) &amp; (datas &lt; CORTE_TESTE)]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">treino, cats = <span class=\"tk-fn\">preparar</span>(treino_cru)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">valid, _ = <span class=\"tk-fn\">preparar</span>(valid_cru, cats)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">candidatos = {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">raso (31 folhas, taxa 0,1)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">dict</span>(max_leaf_nodes=<span class=\"tk-num\">31</span>, learning_rate=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.1</span>, max_iter=<span class=\"tk-num\">200</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">              <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">profundo (63 folhas, taxa 0,1)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">dict</span>(max_leaf_nodes=<span class=\"tk-num\">63</span>, learning_rate=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.1</span>, max_iter=<span class=\"tk-num\">300</span>)}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">resultado_validacao = {}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome, params <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> candidatos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">    m = <span class=\"tk-fn\">HistGradientBoostingClassifier</span>(categorical_features=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">from_dtype</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, early_stopping=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">                                       random_state=SEMENTE, **params).<span class=\"tk-fn\">fit</span>(treino[VARIAVEIS], treino.alvo)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">    resultado_validacao[nome] = <span class=\"tk-fn\">average_precision_score</span>(valid.alvo, m.<span class=\"tk-fn\">predict_proba</span>(valid[VARIAVEIS])[:, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">escolhido = <span class=\"tk-bi\">max</span>(resultado_validacao, key=resultado_validacao.get)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>({k: <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(v, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k, v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> resultado_validacao.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>()}, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">-&gt; escolhido:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, escolhido)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">{'raso (31 folhas, taxa 0,1)': 0.1438, 'profundo (63 folhas, taxa 0,1)': 0.141} -&gt; escolhido: raso (31 folhas, taxa 0,1)</pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"secao-10-3\">10.3 Desempenho no teste, contra linhas de base</h3>\n<p>O modelo escolhido é reajustado com treino + validação (jan/2023 a dez/2025) e avaliado em jan–ago/2026. Duas linhas de base:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>prevalência:</strong> a mesma probabilidade para todo voo (a taxa histórica de atraso). É a referência do Brier.</li>\n<li><strong>histórico companhia × hora:</strong> a taxa de atraso de cada companhia em cada hora prevista, no período de treino. É a regra que uma equipe montaria numa planilha.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">treino_final, cats = <span class=\"tk-fn\">preparar</span>(dados_ml[datas &lt; CORTE_TESTE])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">teste, _ = <span class=\"tk-fn\">preparar</span>(dados_ml[datas &gt;= CORTE_TESTE], cats)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">modelo = <span class=\"tk-fn\">HistGradientBoostingClassifier</span>(categorical_features=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">from_dtype</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, early_stopping=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">                                        random_state=SEMENTE, **candidatos[escolhido])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">modelo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">fit</span>(treino_final[VARIAVEIS], treino_final.alvo)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">p_modelo = modelo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">predict_proba</span>(teste[VARIAVEIS])[:, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">prevalencia = treino_final.alvo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">p_prev = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">full</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(teste), prevalencia)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">taxa_hist = treino_final.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hora_prevista</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], observed=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>).alvo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">p_hist = teste.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_index</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hora_prevista</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]).index.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map</span>(taxa_hist).<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>(dtype=<span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">p_hist = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">where</span>(np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isnan</span>(p_hist), prevalencia, p_hist)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">metricas = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>([</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">    {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">modelo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: nome, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ROC-AUC</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-fn\">roc_auc_score</span>(teste.alvo, p), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">PR-AUC</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-fn\">average_precision_score</span>(teste.alvo, p),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">     <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Brier</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-fn\">brier_score_loss</span>(teste.alvo, p)}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome, p <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> [(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">prevalência</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, p_prev), (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">histórico companhia × hora</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, p_hist), (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">gradient boosting</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, p_modelo)]])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">metricas[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Brier skill (vs prevalência)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> - metricas.Brier / metricas.Brier.iloc[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">metricas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_csv</span>(PASTA_AGREGADOS / <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ml_metricas_teste.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, float_format=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%.5f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">teste: </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(teste), <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> voos, taxa de atraso &gt; 30 min = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * teste.alvo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>())<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> %; </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">      <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">risco médio previsto pelo modelo = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * p_modelo.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>())<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> %</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">tabela</span>(metricas, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" dat