n class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">10 % dos voos com maior risco: taxa de atraso de </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(lift.loc[<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">taxa_atraso_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>])<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> % </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">      <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">(lift </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(lift.loc[<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">lift</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>], <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">×) e </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * captura_top10)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> % de todos os atrasos &gt; 30 min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">amostra = teste.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sample</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">60_000</span>, random_state=SEMENTE)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">imp = <span class=\"tk-fn\">permutation_importance</span>(modelo, amostra[VARIAVEIS], amostra.alvo, scoring=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">roc_auc</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, n_repeats=<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>, random_state=SEMENTE)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">importancia = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">variável</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: VARIAVEIS, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">queda_no_ROC_AUC</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: imp.importances_mean}).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">queda_no_ROC_AUC</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">tabela</span>(lift[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">taxa_atraso_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">lift</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">reset_index</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">rename</span>(columns={<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">voos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>}), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">10 % dos voos com maior risco: taxa de atraso de 15,6 % (lift 2,09×) e 20,9 % de todos os atrasos &gt; 30 min</pre><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">decil_de_risco</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">voos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">taxa_atraso_%</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">lift</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.904</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2,20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,29</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.901</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3,55</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,47</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td class=\"num\">3</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.900</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,54</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,61</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.904</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5,58</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,75</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td class=\"num\">5</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.901</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6,56</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td class=\"num\">6</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.900</td>\n<td class=\"num\">7,64</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">6</th>\n<td class=\"num\">7</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.902</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8,32</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">7</th>\n<td class=\"num\">8</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.902</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9,74</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">8</th>\n<td class=\"num\">9</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.901</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11,05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,48</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">9</th>\n<td class=\"num\">10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">50.902</td>\n<td class=\"num\">15,62</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2,09</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">tabela</span>(importancia, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">variável</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">queda_no_ROC_AUC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td>hora_prevista</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0866</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>origem</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0431</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">7</th>\n<td>partidas_origem_hora</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0344</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>destino</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0185</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td>dia_semana</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0169</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>empresa</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0140</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">5</th>\n<td>mes</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0125</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">8</th>\n<td>chegadas_destino_hora</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">6</th>\n<td>duracao_prevista_min</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,0014</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>O ganho é <strong>real e modesto</strong>: ROC-AUC perto de 0,65. O atraso depende muito do que acontece no próprio dia (clima, um atraso anterior do mesmo avião, controle de tráfego), que nenhuma variável da malha conhece.</li>\n<li>O modelo serve para <strong>ordenar</strong> voos por risco, não para prever um voo isolado. A ordem dos decis é preservada, mas os pontos ficam um pouco acima da diagonal: em 2026 o modelo subestima levemente o risco, um sinal de mudança em relação ao treino que pede recalibração periódica antes de usar a probabilidade como estimativa de quantos voos vão atrasar.</li>\n<li>A importância por permutação mede o quanto o ROC-AUC cai quando a variável é embaralhada; variáveis correlacionadas (hora e congestionamento) dividem a importância entre si.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n",
